    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> Summon your vestige (from the module's Summoned Creatures compendium) as a Celestial, Fiend or Undead; summoning again replaces it (module). AC 13 + CHA, HP 4 + 4 x Warlock level, Fly 30 ft, Vestige's Strike with your spell attack (melee or 60 ft, 1d6 + 3 + CHA Radiant/Fire/Necrotic), Pact Bond (+PB to its checks and saves). Divine Power (1/day, Bonus Action): Healing Touch (Celestial), Fiendish Swap (Fiend, the module swaps you) or Cursed Invocation (Undead, the module curses the target).</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
